-rather than relying on the auto-assignment of the ID::
-
-    >>> b3 = Blog(id=3, name='Cheddar Talk', tagline='Thoughts on cheese.')
-    >>> b3.id     # Returns 3.
-    >>> b3.save()
-    >>> b3.id     # Returns 3.
