-**Month**
-``m``             Month, 2 digits with leading zeros.       ``'01'`` to ``'12'``
-``n``             Month without leading zeros.              ``'1'`` to ``'12'``
-``M``             Month, textual, 3 letters.                ``'Jan'``
-``b``             Month, textual, 3 letters, lowercase.     ``'jan'``
-``E``             Month, locale specific alternative
