@@ -66,3 +19,50 @@ Bugfixes
-* Replaced a possibly incorrect redirect from ``SessionMiddleware`` when a
-  session is destroyed in a concurrent request with a ``SuspiciousOperation``
-  to indicate that the request can't be completed (:ticket:`27363`).
