@@ -174 +56,0 @@ Bugfixes
-* Added tablespace SQL to apps with migrations (:ticket:`24051`).
@@ -176,2 +57,0 @@ Bugfixes
-* Corrected ``contrib.sites`` default site creation in a multiple database
-  setup (:ticket:`24000`).
@@ -179,2 +58,0 @@ Bugfixes
-* Restored support for objects that aren't :class:`str` or :class:`bytes` in
